# ============================================================================
# REPAYD — complete environment reference
# ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Copy to .env (gitignored) and fill what you need. NOTHING is required for
# the local demo except the demo actor keys (public anvil test vectors, safe
# to commit — they only work on a throwaway local chain).
#
# Sections:
#   [A] Demo actors (local demo only — PUBLIC test keys, no secrets)
#   [B] Chain selection (local anvil vs Arc testnet vs Arc mainnet)
#   [C] Coverage API server
#   [D] Dashboard / theater
#   [E] Hedera x402 service (testnet — REAL paid settlements)
#   [F] Circle Agent Stack (sandbox)
#   [G] ERC-8004 orchestrator (live Arc mirror)
# ============================================================================

# ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# [A] DEMO ACTORS — public anvil test vectors (contracts/script/Deploy.s.sol).
#     Required by: packages/demo, run-demo.sh, run-demo-trigger.sh
#     These keys hold funds ONLY on your local anvil. Never use on mainnet.
# ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
AMARA_PRIVATE_KEY=0x59c6995e998f97a5a0044966f0945389dc9e86dae88c7a8412f4603b6b78690d
NUNO_PRIVATE_KEY=0x5de4111afa1a4b94908f83103eb1f1706367c2e68ca870fc3fb9a804cdab365a
WATCHER_PRIVATE_KEY=0x8b3a350cf5c34c9194ca85829a2df0ec3153be0318b5e2d3348e872092edffba
AGENT_KEY_PRIVATE_KEY=0x92db14e403b83dfe3df233f83dfa3a0d7096f21ca9b0d6d6b8d88b2b4ec1564e
# Optional (defaults in Deploy.s.sol):
# RAVI_PRIVATE_KEY=0x5de4111afa1a4b94908f83103eb1f1706367c2e68ca870fc3fb9a804cdab365a
# SENIOR_PRIVATE_KEY=0x7c852118294e51e653712a81e05800f419141751be58f605c371e15141b007a6

# ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# [B] CHAIN SELECTION — which chain the demo attaches to.
#     DEMO_RPC_URL is REQUIRED (no default, by design).
#     DEMO_CHAIN_ID must match the chain the contracts are deployed on
#     (EIP-712 verdict digests embed chainId — a mismatch fails ecrecover).
# ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Local demo (default path):
DEMO_RPC_URL=http://localhost:8545
DEMO_CHAIN_ID=31337
# Arc testnet (the LIVE stack — see docs/REPAYD_STATUS_REPORT.md §3.1):
# DEMO_RPC_URL=https://rpc.testnet.arc.io
# DEMO_CHAIN_ID=5042002
# Arc mainnet rider (unlocks +$5,000; needs a funded deployer first):
# DEMO_RPC_URL=<arc-mainnet-rpc>
# DEMO_CHAIN_ID=<arc-mainnet-chainid>

# Read-only RPC for the API server's live chain reads (defaults to Arc testnet):
ARC_RPC_URL=http://localhost:8545
# Set for LOCAL demo reads; unset/blank → https://rpc.testnet.arc.io

# ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# [C] COVERAGE API (packages/api) — Bun HTTP server.
# ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
REPAYD_API_PORT=8787
# DEPLOYMENT_CHAIN_ID picks which deployments/<id>.json the API loads.
# The overview/circle endpoints hardcode Arc testnet (5042002) — for local
# runs keep the alias file contracts/deployments/5042002.json in sync
# (run-demo.sh does this for you).
# DEPLOYMENT_CHAIN_ID=5042002

# ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# [D] DASHBOARD / THEATER (packages/dashboard).
# ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
REPAYD_DASH_PORT=3000
REPAYD_API_URL=http://localhost:8787
# Demo → theater push. Set on the DEMO process so its events reach the page:
REPAYD_THEATER_INGEST=http://localhost:3000/api/theater/ingest

# ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# [E] HEDERA x402 SERVICE (packages/hedera) — AI & Agentic Payments track.
#     Accounts: create 2 ECDSA testnet accounts at portal.hedera.com,
#     fund via the built-in faucet. The payer needs only its transfer
#     balance (facilitator 0.0.7162784 pays network fees); the service
#     account needs a little HBAR for HCS audit submits.
#     WITHOUT keys the service runs in dry-run (healthz shows "hcsAudit":"dry-run").
# ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
REPAYD_X402_PORT=4601
HEDERA_NETWORK=testnet
X402_FACILITATOR_URL=https://api.testnet.blocky402.com   # open access, no key
# payTo account — RECEIVES the 0.001–0.002 ℏ per-request payments:
HEDERA_SERVICE_ID=0.0.10484593
HEDERA_SERVICE_KEY=0x…        # ECDSA DER or raw hex; enables live HCS audit
# payer agent — executes the REAL paid request (scripts/paid-request.ts):
HEDERA_OPERATOR_ID=0.0.10484477
HEDERA_OPERATOR_KEY=0x…
HEDERA_RECEIPT_TOPIC_ID=0.0.10493275   # optional; auto-created when unset+live
# Recurring-premium scheduled draw (scripts/schedule-premium.ts):
REPAYD_PREMIUM_HBAR=0.001
REPAYD_SERVICE_URL=http://localhost:4601

# ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# [F] CIRCLE AGENT STACK (packages/api/src/circle/agent-wallet.ts).
#     Key from console.circle.com → API Keys. Sandbox is free.
#     WITHOUT them the endpoint serves structured dry-run calls.
# ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# CIRCLE_API_KEY=TEST_API_KEY:xxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxx:xxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxxx
# CIRCLE_ENTITY_SECRET=…       # one-shot console registration (recovery file!)
# CIRCLE_WALLET_SET_ID=…       # optional reuse
# CIRCLE_AGENT_WALLET_ADDRESS=…
# CIRCLE_DEMO_SPEND=1          # gate the single demo USDC spend

# ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# [G] ERC-8004 ORCHESTRATOR (packages/api/src/erc8004-orchestrator.ts).
#     Watches VerdictAccepted/HoldVerdictRouted on Arc and mirrors verdicts
#     to the canonical identity/validation/reputation registries.
#     Gas on Arc testnet is native USDC — fund each role via faucet.circle.com.
# ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
ARC_OPS_KEY=0x…               # ops/owner of agent identity (paid demo txs)
ARC_WATCHER_KEY=0x…           # must equal VerdictContract.watcher on-chain
ARC_REPUTATION_KEY=0x…        # posts reputation feedback
ARC_AGENT_ID=894341           # the registered agent identity
# Smoke-test trio (packages/api/scripts/arc-smoke.ts) — disposable:
# ARC_SMOKE_OPS_KEY=0x…
# ARC_SMOKE_WATCHER_KEY=0x…
# ARC_SMOKE_REPUTATION_KEY=0x…
